# What must not go into the build context.
#
# Not only for speed. `bin` and `obj` from a Windows machine landing in a Linux build produce
# restore errors that read as package problems, and a local node_modules shadows the one `npm ci`
# installs for the right platform.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Built output. The image builds its own.
src/ProofFlow.Web/wwwroot/build/

# Local state, some of it secret.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/App_Data/
**/keys/
.env

# Evidence and history, neither of which the application runs on.
docs/ui/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.git/
.github/
